OL,3,AMore than 30 killed in Pakistan school
OL,4,Aroof collapse as police warn building
OL,5,Astill 'extremely dangerous'
OL,6,
OL,7,FAt least 34 people have been killed
OL,8,Fafter a school roof collapsed in
OL,9,FPeshawar, Pakistan, with the majority
OL,10,Fthought to be children under the age of
OL,11,F13
OL,13,FThe owner of the school has been
OL,14,Farrested, with Peshawar police warning
OL,15,F"the building is extremely dangerous
OL,16,Fand there is a risk of further
OL,17,Fcollapse"
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
