OL,3,AMore than 30 killed in Pakistan school
OL,4,Aroof collapse as police warn building
OL,5,Astill 'extremely dangerous'
OL,6,
OL,7,FA local official says emergency
OL,8,Fservices were first alerted to the
OL,9,Fincident at the private Al-Khair school
OL,10,Fin the Dir Colony neighbourhood at
OL,11,F08:48 local time (04:48 BST) - here's a
OL,12,Fmap of the area
OL,14,FEarlier, rescuers searched the rubble
OL,15,Ffor survivors. A local teacher, who
OL,16,Fhelped, tells BBC Urdu he "pulled out
OL,17,Fsix children" and recalls one being "in
OL,18,Fa lot of pain"
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
