OL,3,AMore than 30 killed in Pakistan school
OL,4,Aroof collapse as police warn building
OL,5,Astill 'extremely dangerous'
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn a statement, Pakistani PM Shehbaz
OL,8,FSharif says "no parent should have to
OL,9,Fendure such pain", adding there'll be a
OL,10,F"thorough investigation"
